---
layout: base.njk
title: Download Atlantis
eleventyComputed:
  description: "Download Atlantis for {% if platforms.only %}macOS, Apple Silicon and Intel in one build{% else %}{{ platforms.names }}{% endif %}, with the changelog for every release."
ground: download
---

<section class="page section section-first" aria-labelledby="download-title">
  <header class="section-head">
    <p class="eyebrow">Download</p>
    <h1 class="title" id="download-title">Atlantis for {{ platforms.names }}</h1>
    <p class="lead">{% if platforms.only %}One build for Apple Silicon and Intel.{% else %}One build for Macs, Apple Silicon and Intel alike, and an x64 build for {{ platforms.others }}.{% endif %} The newest few releases stay hosted, and the changelog of every release stays on this page.</p>
    {%- if alpha %}
    <p class="lead">Atlantis is in alpha. It works, but it is early: you install it and set it up yourself, with a model key of your own, and things change from one release to the next.</p>
    {%- endif %}
  </header>

  {%- if releases.length %}
    {%- for release in releases %}
      {%- set full = true %}
      {% include "release.njk" %}
    {%- endfor %}
    {% include "notify.njk" %}
  {%- else %}
    <div class="glass empty">
      <img src="/assets/app-icon.png" alt="" width="72" height="72" />
      {%- if site.kit %}
      <p class="lead">The first build is on its way. Get notified when it lands.</p>
      {% include "waitlist.njk" %}
      {%- else %}
      <p class="lead">The first build is on its way. It will be here the moment it ships.</p>
      {%- endif %}
      <p class="caption">One download for Apple Silicon and Intel Macs.</p>
    </div>
  {%- endif %}

  {% include "requirements.njk" %}
</section>
